---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = '2026年中国签证类型指南：您需要哪种签证？';
const description = '2026年中国游客签证类型的完整指南：免签证、240小时过境和L型旅游签证。';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="zh">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12">
    <!-- Header -->
    <header class="mb-12">
      <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/" class="text-sm text-brand-600 hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-1 mb-4">← 签证和入境</a>
      <div class="text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium tracking-wide uppercase mb-3"><h3类=</div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 leading-tight mb-4">
        China Visa Types Complete Guide 2026: Which Visa Do You Need?
      </h1>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <strong>进入中国比几年前更容易。</strong>
      </p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Depending on your nationality and travel plans, you might be able to enter China without a visa, take advantage of the 240-hour transit policy, or apply for a standard tourist visa. For most travelers, the process is straightforward once you figure out which option applies to your situation.
      </p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">访问中国需要签证吗？</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        <strong>不是每个人都需要传统的中国签证。</strong> There are currently three common ways to enter China:
      </p>

      <!-- Section 1: Visa-Free -->
      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">1</span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 m-0">免签证入境</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          China currently grants visa-free entry to citizens of 50 countries for stays of up to 30 days. If your passport is from one of these countries, you can literally book a flight and walk through Chinese immigration without having applied for anything in advance. Just make sure your passport is valid for at least 6 months beyond your entry date, and you're good to go.
        </p>
          <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/visa-free/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium hover:underline">
          China Visa-Free Countries List (2026) →
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 2: 240-Hour Transit -->
      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">2</span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 m-0">240小时免签证过境</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Travelers from eligible countries can stay in China for up to 240 hours (10 days) while transiting to a third country or region (including Hong Kong, Macau, and Taiwan).
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          This option is popular with travelers making stopovers in cities like Shanghai, Beijing, Guangzhou, and Chengdu. <strong>重要提示：</strong> This policy only applies to entries through international airports, not land border crossings.
        </p>
        <a href="/zh/prepare/visa/transit-240/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium hover:underline">
          China 240-Hour Visa-Free Transit Explained →
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 3: Tourist Visa -->
      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
          <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 text-sm font-bold flex items-center justify-center">3</span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 m-0">旅游签证（L型）</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          If neither of the options above works for you, you'll typically need a Chinese L-type Tourist Visa.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          The application process is generally straightforward and requires:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-gray-700 mb-4">
          <li>有效护照</li>
          <li>申请表格</li>
          <li>近照</li>
          <li>证明文件（按要求）</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium hover:underline">
          How to Apply for a Chinese Tourist Visa →
        </a>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">需要多长时间？</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Processing times vary by country and visa center. In most locations, standard processing takes 4–5 business days, though faster expedited services may be available for an additional fee.
      </p>

      <a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-brand-600 font-medium hover:underline">
        China Visa Processing Time Explained →
      </a>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">哪种选择适合你？</h2>

      <div class="bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-8 not-prose">
        <table class="w-full text-left">
          <thead class="bg-gray-50">
            <tr>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900"></th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">30天免签证</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">240小时交通</th>
              <th class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900">L旅游签证</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100">
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700"><strong>谁有资格</strong></td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">50个符合条件的国家</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">55个符合条件的国家+过境路线</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">其他人</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700"><strong>最大停留时间</strong></td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">30天</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">10天（240小时）</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">30-90天</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700"><strong>提前文书工作</strong></td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">None</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">无（只显示）</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">4-5周</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700"><strong>Cost</strong></td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">Free</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">Free</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">30美元-100美元</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="hover:bg-gray-50">
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700"><strong>Flexibility</strong></td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">随时随地旅行</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">区域受限</td>
              <td class="px-6 py-4 text-gray-700">Travel anywhere</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">常见问题</h2>

      <div class="space-y-6 mb-8">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">免签证入境与签证相同吗？</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed"><strong>号码</strong> Visa-free entry means you don't need a visa stamp in your passport at all. You just show your passport to immigration and they let you in. It'<tr类='s the absence of one.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">免签证入境后，我需要向警方登记吗？</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">如果你住在酒店，他们会自动处理登记。如果你住在私人住宅，你的主人需要在24小时内在当地警察局为你登记。无论你是如何进入中国的，这都适用。</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-2">如果我有双重国籍怎么办？</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">中国不承认双重国籍。使用您打算进入中国的护照。如果你的护照来自免签证国家，那就用它——它简化了一切。</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        Before applying for a visa, check whether you qualify for visa-free entry or the 240-hour transit policy. If not, a standard L-type Tourist Visa remains the most common route for visitors.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
